WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.467
Also this

00:00:00.467 --> 00:00:01.701
morning, the Department of Justice

00:00:01.701 --> 00:00:02.102
has now

00:00:02.102 --> 00:00:03.536
launched an investigation

00:00:03.536 --> 00:00:05.472
into the leak of Pentagon documents

00:00:05.472 --> 00:00:07.107
that were posted online.

00:00:07.107 --> 00:00:07.440
U.S.

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:08.475
officials have confirmed

00:00:08.475 --> 00:00:10.777
that some of the documents are authentic.

00:00:10.777 --> 00:00:12.445
The leak poses a serious risk

00:00:12.445 --> 00:00:13.646
to relationships with U.S.

00:00:13.646 --> 00:00:16.649
allies and military options in Ukraine,

00:00:16.683 --> 00:00:18.918
but there is also a concern from Ukraine.

00:00:18.985 --> 00:00:20.520
The documents may have been altered

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:21.154
or may be part

00:00:21.154 --> 00:00:23.089
of a misinformation campaign.

00:00:23.089 --> 00:00:24.057
For perspective on this,

00:00:24.057 --> 00:00:25.525
joining us now is retired U.S.

00:00:25.525 --> 00:00:27.327
Army Major Mike Lyons.

00:00:27.327 --> 00:00:29.095
I mean, this is astounding

00:00:29.095 --> 00:00:31.231
because what these documents show, one

00:00:31.231 --> 00:00:33.066
is, as The New York Times put it,

00:00:33.066 --> 00:00:33.967
that the U.S.

00:00:33.967 --> 00:00:35.301
has basically penetrated

00:00:35.301 --> 00:00:36.536
every Russian security

00:00:36.536 --> 00:00:38.471
apparatus, has great insight into it.

00:00:38.471 --> 00:00:39.305
But as David Sanger

00:00:39.305 --> 00:00:40.740
writes in The New York Times today,

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:41.007
you know,

00:00:41.007 --> 00:00:41.941
this is a disclosure

00:00:41.941 --> 00:00:43.309
because this fall out in real time,

00:00:43.309 --> 00:00:44.411
because some of these documents

00:00:44.411 --> 00:00:45.945
aren't even 40 days old.

00:00:45.945 --> 00:00:47.514
So you can actually see what they know

00:00:47.514 --> 00:00:48.381
right now

00:00:48.381 --> 00:00:49.883
about what's happening in Ukraine.

00:00:49.883 --> 00:00:50.784
Yeah, that's right.

00:00:50.784 --> 00:00:51.584
I'm having a hard time

00:00:51.584 --> 00:00:52.352
getting my head around this.

00:00:52.352 --> 00:00:52.719
I mean,

00:00:52.719 --> 00:00:54.187
if there's 50 classified

00:00:54.187 --> 00:00:55.955
documents, there's 50 separate stories

00:00:55.955 --> 00:00:57.991
that are going to impact on the ground

00:00:57.991 --> 00:00:58.992
in Ukraine right now.

00:00:58.992 --> 00:01:01.327
The fact that they gave away their air

00:01:01.327 --> 00:01:02.162
defense platforms

00:01:02.162 --> 00:01:03.096
and where those locations,

00:01:03.096 --> 00:01:04.931
where they affect troop movements,

00:01:04.931 --> 00:01:06.332
they're talking about artillery rounds.

00:01:06.332 --> 00:01:07.333
We all know that Ukraine

00:01:07.333 --> 00:01:08.735
is running out of artillery.

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:11.438
So the this level of of breach

00:01:11.438 --> 00:01:12.605
is significant.

00:01:12.605 --> 00:01:13.373
And the fact that

00:01:13.373 --> 00:01:14.707
we've kind of asleep at the switch,

00:01:14.707 --> 00:01:15.575
we had indications

00:01:15.575 --> 00:01:17.343
it was going on the past few months.

00:01:17.343 --> 00:01:18.344
We've got to do a better job

00:01:18.344 --> 00:01:19.646
monitoring these sites,

00:01:19.646 --> 00:01:20.647
these discord sites

00:01:20.647 --> 00:01:21.915
that have this kind of information

00:01:21.915 --> 00:01:22.482
out there.

00:01:22.482 --> 00:01:24.050
It came from the highest levels

00:01:24.050 --> 00:01:24.684
of our government,

00:01:24.684 --> 00:01:25.552
the Joint Staff,

00:01:25.552 --> 00:01:26.753
these documents, they were

00:01:26.753 --> 00:01:27.520
they were removed,

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:28.922
obviously, from a briefing

00:01:28.922 --> 00:01:30.256
and there were pictures

00:01:30.256 --> 00:01:31.558
of these presentations.

00:01:31.558 --> 00:01:32.659
So so again,

00:01:32.659 --> 00:01:33.726
the damage assessment,

00:01:33.726 --> 00:01:35.028
I still think is going on

00:01:35.028 --> 00:01:36.229
and it's very significant.

00:01:36.229 --> 00:01:37.230
And now all these holes

00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:38.431
are likely getting close up.

00:01:38.431 --> 00:01:39.499
It's going to cause significant

00:01:39.499 --> 00:01:41.334
trust issues between us and Ukraine.

00:01:41.334 --> 00:01:42.602
But it does put into

00:01:42.602 --> 00:01:43.903
perspective, don't you think, the story

00:01:43.903 --> 00:01:44.671
that we've been covering

00:01:44.671 --> 00:01:46.039
about all of these classified documents

00:01:46.039 --> 00:01:46.840
that are ending up,

00:01:46.840 --> 00:01:48.441
you know, at personal residences

00:01:48.441 --> 00:01:49.676
and so forth,

00:01:49.676 --> 00:01:52.846
just the danger that this poses.

00:01:53.012 --> 00:01:53.480
Correct.

00:01:53.480 --> 00:01:54.013
It does, Don.

00:01:54.013 --> 00:01:56.015
It's not just overclassification.

00:01:56.015 --> 00:01:57.650
This is serious stuff.

00:01:57.650 --> 00:01:58.485
I mean, this is know

00:01:58.485 --> 00:01:59.219
things get over

00:01:59.219 --> 00:02:00.253
classified based on

00:02:00.253 --> 00:02:01.921
what might embarrass things

00:02:01.921 --> 00:02:02.755
within our country.

00:02:02.755 --> 00:02:04.157
This has national security

00:02:04.157 --> 00:02:06.126
implications on the ground,

00:02:06.126 --> 00:02:07.594
signals intelligence, SIGINT,

00:02:07.594 --> 00:02:08.595
and so to speak.

00:02:08.595 --> 00:02:10.864
It shows us eavesdropping on our allies.

00:02:11.498 --> 00:02:14.701
It speaks to the fact that humans, now

00:02:15.001 --> 00:02:15.768
human intelligence

00:02:15.768 --> 00:02:17.837
sources, could be burned on the ground

00:02:17.837 --> 00:02:18.404
people could be

00:02:18.404 --> 00:02:19.339
lives are at stake now

00:02:19.339 --> 00:02:20.340
with this kind of stuff.

00:02:20.340 --> 00:02:21.808
I mean, Kayla makes such a good point

00:02:21.808 --> 00:02:23.476
about like real time

00:02:23.476 --> 00:02:24.944
right now, information

00:02:24.944 --> 00:02:26.980
about Ukraine, etc..

00:02:27.347 --> 00:02:28.481
But at the same time,

00:02:28.481 --> 00:02:30.116
what was also included

00:02:30.116 --> 00:02:31.384
in the reporting from the Times over

00:02:31.384 --> 00:02:33.486
the weekend is sensitive

00:02:33.486 --> 00:02:34.954
briefing slides on China

00:02:34.954 --> 00:02:35.555
and sort of

00:02:35.555 --> 00:02:37.657
the entire Indo-Pacific military theater,

00:02:37.690 --> 00:02:39.659
the Middle East, terrorism.

00:02:39.659 --> 00:02:40.560
It goes so far,

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:42.295
even beyond the current conflict.

00:02:42.295 --> 00:02:44.497
I mean, considering relations with what

00:02:44.497 --> 00:02:45.932
China and Taiwan look look

00:02:45.932 --> 00:02:47.433
what's happening right now. Yeah.

00:02:47.433 --> 00:02:48.535
The intelligence agencies

00:02:48.535 --> 00:02:50.270
now have got to focus on this

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:50.970
to close

00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:52.705
gaps, mitigate risk,

00:02:52.705 --> 00:02:54.707
figure out what the damage is with regard

00:02:54.707 --> 00:02:56.109
to this disinformation,

00:02:56.109 --> 00:02:57.477
taking our eye off the ball

00:02:57.477 --> 00:02:59.012
and what's happening in the Pacific.

00:02:59.012 --> 00:03:00.480
China Russia could use this

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:02.048
against our Democratic

00:03:02.048 --> 00:03:02.882
allies and say, look,

00:03:02.882 --> 00:03:04.217
why should you trust the United States?

00:03:04.217 --> 00:03:05.151
You're going to give them information.

00:03:05.151 --> 00:03:05.818
Some US information

00:03:05.818 --> 00:03:07.554
came from other countries.

00:03:07.554 --> 00:03:09.656
It had certain classifications

00:03:09.656 --> 00:03:11.491
that only certain other countries

00:03:11.491 --> 00:03:12.725
had New Zealand, Australia,

00:03:12.725 --> 00:03:15.261
not even normal allies, so to speak.

00:03:15.261 --> 00:03:17.897
So this is a significant breach

00:03:18.331 --> 00:03:20.133
up there with Snowden, WikiLeaks.

00:03:20.133 --> 00:03:20.967
With regard,

00:03:20.967 --> 00:03:22.669
I hope we're closing ranks pretty quickly

00:03:22.669 --> 00:03:23.603
to figure out what happened.

00:03:23.603 --> 00:03:25.572
And the point that David Sanger

00:03:25.572 --> 00:03:27.373
makes with Snowden is those were

00:03:27.373 --> 00:03:28.741
things were three years old.

00:03:28.741 --> 00:03:31.277
And this is because of how new this is,

00:03:31.277 --> 00:03:31.544
you know,

00:03:31.544 --> 00:03:32.612
eavesdropping on allies,

00:03:32.612 --> 00:03:34.380
spying on allies, not exactly a surprise.

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:35.615
Everyone knows it. Everyone does it.

00:03:35.615 --> 00:03:36.416
But it's the idea

00:03:36.416 --> 00:03:37.884
that it's put out in the forefront

00:03:37.884 --> 00:03:39.652
can cause tension in those relationships.

00:03:39.652 --> 00:03:40.553
What I was most struck

00:03:40.553 --> 00:03:41.754
by was what they said

00:03:41.754 --> 00:03:43.089
about what's happening in Israel.

00:03:43.089 --> 00:03:45.024
And there was essentially this allegation

00:03:45.024 --> 00:03:45.892
it was intelligence

00:03:45.892 --> 00:03:47.227
that Mossad

00:03:47.227 --> 00:03:49.429
is basically the spy chiefs in Israel

00:03:49.429 --> 00:03:50.964
had helped foment

00:03:50.964 --> 00:03:52.665
the protests that we've all play out

00:03:52.665 --> 00:03:54.400
that we've been covering here every day

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:56.202
when it comes to the judicial reform

00:03:56.202 --> 00:03:57.270
that's happening in Israel.

00:03:57.270 --> 00:03:58.905
Yeah, it gets to the reason

00:03:58.905 --> 00:04:00.873
why these documents were released.

00:04:00.873 --> 00:04:01.441
You know, did

00:04:01.441 --> 00:04:03.643
someone have this level of intellect

00:04:03.643 --> 00:04:04.410
that recognize

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:05.178
that that would cause

00:04:05.178 --> 00:04:06.713
that kind of a problem?

00:04:06.713 --> 00:04:08.081
But again, that came from

00:04:08.081 --> 00:04:08.915
signals intelligence,

00:04:08.915 --> 00:04:10.049
signals operations,

00:04:10.049 --> 00:04:12.118
eavesdropping, so to speak.

00:04:12.118 --> 00:04:14.587
But whether or not the United States had

00:04:14.787 --> 00:04:15.154
any say

00:04:15.154 --> 00:04:16.623
in that really remains to be seen.

00:04:16.623 --> 00:04:16.923
But but

00:04:16.923 --> 00:04:18.958
the person who released this information

00:04:18.958 --> 00:04:20.793
clearly wanted to hurt the US,

00:04:20.793 --> 00:04:21.694
Israel relations

00:04:21.694 --> 00:04:23.963
with that kind of breach. Yeah.

00:04:23.963 --> 00:04:25.231
And just our allies

00:04:25.231 --> 00:04:26.199
relationships, as you said, it's

00:04:26.199 --> 00:04:26.833
not surprising

00:04:26.833 --> 00:04:28.501
that everybody spies on everyone,

00:04:28.501 --> 00:04:31.137
but still it's not out there for everyone

00:04:31.137 --> 00:04:31.571
to read.

00:04:31.571 --> 00:04:32.205
Well, and remember,

00:04:32.205 --> 00:04:34.440
whenever it was reported about,

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:34.874
you know,

00:04:34.874 --> 00:04:35.942
with Merkel

00:04:35.942 --> 00:04:37.377
when she was the German chancellor

00:04:37.377 --> 00:04:38.911
and it caused a huge rift

00:04:38.911 --> 00:04:40.980
with the Obama White House.

00:04:40.980 --> 00:04:41.881
Yeah, just amazing.

00:04:41.881 --> 00:04:42.982
I mean, we'll continue to see where

00:04:42.982 --> 00:04:44.384
this investigation goes.

00:04:44.384 --> 00:04:44.784
Thank you

00:04:44.784 --> 00:04:46.819
for stating the significance of it

00:04:46.819 --> 00:04:48.187
this morning. Thanks my clients.

